  "solution": {
    "text": "$f(x)$ is defined if\r\n\r\n$\\begin{array}{l} -\\log _{1 / 2}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{x^{1 / 4}}\\right)-1 > 0 \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\quad \\log _{1 / 2}\\left(1+\\frac{1}{x^{1 / 4}}\\right) < -1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\quad 1+\\frac{1}{x^{1 / 4}} > \\left(\\frac{1}{2}\\right)^{-1} \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\quad \\frac{1}{x^{1 / 4}} > 1 \\\\ \\Rightarrow \\quad 0 < x < 1 \\end{array}$",
